    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 关于逼上梁山的误解：水浒好汉来源总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 那些残暴的细节：重读水浒的最大冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 水浒中的义气：有些是义气，有些根本不是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 对照人物：鲁智深vs李逵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 对照人物：林冲vs杨志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 对照人物：晁盖vs宋江</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 三个女性：阎婆惜、潘金莲、潘巧云</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 水浒小角色：李忠、瓦罐寺老和尚、李小二、郓哥、阎婆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 好汉令人嘲讽的时刻：林冲、武松、宋江、柴进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3261">54:21</a> 我欣赏的小细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 我喜欢的人物：鲁智深的侠气与佛性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 宋朝人身高衣服鞋子小常识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 水浒的开头与收尾：落了片白茫茫大地真干净</span></p>]]></description>
