  <item>
    <title>033 《飞凰引》| 如何度过夏天，吃西瓜喝可乐看网文</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a24da97349f7a55784cf8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a24da97349f7a55784cf8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果做了太多正经事，就需要读一本网文来平衡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音频录制时窗外有雨，所以也许会有雨滴砸在玻璃窗上的声音。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 我筛选网文的标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 情节简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 优点：伏笔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 关于陆九什么时候动心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> 陆九为什么要跟小七缚绞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 人物分析：复杂人物陆九</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a>5 陆九攻略小七</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 兽笼大战为什么是最强攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 陆九最大命门：畏惧权力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 人物分析：光风霁月小七</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> 象征手法：黑马，寿宴落雨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">52:05</a> 优秀的转场：塔兰受辱，陆九的梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 遗憾：男性成长，男主变成贵族</span></p>]]></description>
