  <item>
    <title>032《玫瑰的故事》原著向 | 玫瑰乃爱情之别名</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667e99fd077b88831be60c77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667e99fd077b88831be60c77</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 11:09:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期基于亦舒原著《玫瑰的故事》，分享了主播的小感受，关于：为什么玫瑰不上班，几位与玫瑰有爱情纠葛的男性的典型性，苏更生与黄振华爱情的典型性，玫瑰的女儿的爱情观等。探讨性别，探讨爱情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 《玫瑰的故事》电视剧印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 那些我愿意为他们看烂片的美人：一美，杜鹃，小辣椒，刘亦菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 《玫瑰的故事》内容简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 书里的玫瑰不上班</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 对书里玫瑰的想象：章小蕙，张曼玉，刘亦菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> 少女玫瑰：周士辉的自私与骨气 ，小男生吞药，砸庄国栋的家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 青年玫瑰：方协文的失败，家敏的一见钟情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 一见钟情与日久生情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 爱人与被爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 家敏恋爱失败后的懦弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 中年玫瑰：草草收尾的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 苏更生与黄振华为什么距爱情差一步：选一颗最好的苹果与唯一的玫瑰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 玫瑰的女儿：新一代爱情观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 爱情是什么：弗洛姆，波伏娃与德波顿</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：w</span></p>]]></description>
